**Percentage change in total debt**

\[
\text{Change} = \frac{28.5\text{ B} - 29.5\text{ B}}{29.5\text{ B}}
              = \frac{-1.0\text{ B}}{29.5\text{ B}}
              = -0.0339 \text{ (approximately)}
\]

\[
\text{Percentage change} = -3.39\%
\]

**Answer:** The total debt decreased by **about 3.4 %** from December 31, 2014 to December 31, 2015.
